node_modules/

# This repo dogfoods the convention: its own .ai/ is committed (curated knowledge,
# guidelines, runbooks) and governed by .ai/.gitignore — personal/in-flight files
# use the `_` prefix to stay local, and .ai/context/ ignores its own contents.

# In the shipped template, context/ holds regenerable session state —
# track the folder + README, ignore the contents.
template/.ai/context/*
!template/.ai/context/gitignore
!template/.ai/context/README.md
